{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"callout","kind":"warning","title":"Warning","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Static Server Functions are experimental!"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"what-are-static-server-functions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What are Static Server Functions?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Static server functions are server functions that are executed at build time and cached as static assets when using prerendering/static-generation. They can be set to \"static\" mode by applying the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"staticFunctionMiddleware"},{"type":"text","value":" middleware to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createServerFn"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createServerFn } from '@tanstack/solid-start'\nimport { staticFunctionMiddleware } from '@tanstack/start-static-server-functions'\n\nconst myServerFn = createServerFn({ method: 'GET' })\n  .middleware([staticFunctionMiddleware])\n  .handler(async () => {\n    return 'Hello, world!'\n  })","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ensure that "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"staticFunctionMiddleware"},{"type":"text","value":" is the final middleware!"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This pattern goes as follows:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build-time"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"During build-time prerendering, a server function with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"staticFunctionMiddleware"},{"type":"text","value":" is executed"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The result is cached with your build output as a static JSON file under a derived key (function ID + params/payload hash)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The result is returned as normal during prerendering/static-generation and used to prerender the page"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Runtime"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Initially, the prerendered page's html is served and the server function data is embedded in the html"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When the client mounts, the embedded server function data is hydrated"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For future client-side invocations, the server function is replaced with a fetch call to the static JSON file"}]}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"what-are-static-server-functions","text":"What are Static Server Functions?","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n> [!WARNING]\n> Static Server Functions are experimental!\n\n## What are Static Server Functions?\n\nStatic server functions are server functions that are executed at build time and cached as static assets when using prerendering/static-generation. They can be set to \"static\" mode by applying the `staticFunctionMiddleware` middleware to `createServerFn`:\n\n```tsx\nimport { createServerFn } from '@tanstack/solid-start'\nimport { staticFunctionMiddleware } from '@tanstack/start-static-server-functions'\n\nconst myServerFn = createServerFn({ method: 'GET' })\n  .middleware([staticFunctionMiddleware])\n  .handler(async () => {\n    return 'Hello, world!'\n  })\n```\n\nEnsure that `staticFunctionMiddleware` is the final middleware!\n\nThis pattern goes as follows:\n\n- Build-time\n  - During build-time prerendering, a server function with `staticFunctionMiddleware` is executed\n  - The result is cached with your build output as a static JSON file under a derived key (function ID + params/payload hash)\n  - The result is returned as normal during prerendering/static-generation and used to prerender the page\n- Runtime\n  - Initially, the prerendered page's html is served and the server function data is embedded in the html\n  - When the client mounts, the embedded server function data is hydrated\n  - For future client-side invocations, the server function is replaced with a fetch call to the static JSON file\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nref: docs/start/framework/react/guide/static-server-functions.md\nreplace:\n  { '@tanstack/react-start': '@tanstack/solid-start', 'React': 'SolidJS' }\n---\n"}
